{% liquid
  assign legal_name = settings.legal_business_name | default: 'ChaliseyZ Central L.L.C.'
  assign policy_title = 'BeardMate policy'
  assign policy_type = 'policy'
  if request.path contains 'privacy-policy'
    assign policy_title = 'Privacy policy'
    assign policy_type = 'privacy'
  elsif request.path contains 'refund-policy'
    assign policy_title = 'Refund policy'
    assign policy_type = 'refund'
  elsif request.path contains 'shipping-policy'
    assign policy_title = 'Shipping policy'
    assign policy_type = 'shipping'
  elsif request.path contains 'terms-of-service' or request.path contains 'terms-of-use'
    assign policy_title = 'Terms of use'
    assign policy_type = 'terms'
  endif
%}

<section class="policy-hero">
  <div class="container policy-hero__inner">
    <p class="reference-eyebrow">BeardMate · {{ legal_name }}</p>
    <h1>{{ policy_title }}</h1>
    <p>Clear terms, accessible support, and straightforward customer care.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="policy-section">
  <div class="container policy-layout">
    <aside class="policy-nav">
      <p>BeardMate policies</p>
      <a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url | default: '/policies/privacy-policy' }}" {% if policy_type == 'privacy' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Privacy policy</a>
      <a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url | default: '/policies/refund-policy' }}" {% if policy_type == 'refund' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Refund policy</a>
      <a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url | default: '/policies/shipping-policy' }}" {% if policy_type == 'shipping' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Shipping policy</a>
      <a href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url | default: '/policies/terms-of-service' }}" {% if policy_type == 'terms' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Terms of use</a>
      <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact BeardMate</a>
    </aside>

    <article class="policy-content rte">
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: July 21, 2026</p>
      <div class="legal-operator-note"><strong>About BeardMate</strong><p>BeardMate is owned and operated by {{ legal_name }}. In these policies, “BeardMate,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to {{ legal_name }}.</p></div>

      {% if policy_type == 'privacy' %}
        <h2>Scope</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how BeardMate collects, uses, discloses, and protects personal information when you visit the BeardMate website, communicate with us, or purchase BeardMate products.</p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>Depending on how you interact with BeardMate, we may collect contact details; billing, shipping, and transaction information; account and customer-support communications; device, browser, cookie, and usage information; and fraud-prevention or security information. Payment-card details are handled by our commerce and payment providers rather than stored in full by BeardMate.</p>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <p>We use personal information to operate and improve BeardMate, process and deliver orders, communicate about purchases, provide customer support, manage returns, personalize your experience, detect fraud, secure our services, comply with law, and send marketing where permitted or requested.</p>

        <h2>How information is disclosed</h2>
        <p>We may disclose information to commerce, payment, fulfillment, delivery, hosting, analytics, advertising, customer-support, and fraud-prevention providers; professional advisers; government authorities when legally required; and parties involved in a legitimate business transaction. These parties receive information only as needed for their functions or as permitted by law.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
        <p>BeardMate and its providers may use cookies and similar technologies to keep the website functional, remember preferences, understand traffic, measure campaigns, and provide advertising. Where required, you can manage optional technologies through available cookie or privacy controls and your browser settings.</p>

        <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
        <p>We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described above, including legal, accounting, fraud-prevention, and dispute-resolution obligations. We use reasonable safeguards, but no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure.</p>

        <h2>Your privacy rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion, portability, restriction, or information about certain disclosures; to withdraw consent; or to opt out of certain targeted advertising, sharing, or sales as defined by applicable law. We may need to verify your identity before completing a request. You may appeal a refusal where local law provides that right.</p>

        <h2>Children’s information</h2>
        <p>BeardMate is not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable law. A parent or guardian may contact us to request deletion.</p>

        <h2>International processing</h2>
        <p>Our service providers may process information in countries outside your own. Where required, appropriate safeguards are used for international transfers.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy to reflect operational, legal, or regulatory changes. The revised version will be posted here with a new “Last updated” date.</p>
      {% elsif policy_type == 'refund' %}
        <h2>30-day return request period</h2>
        <p>You may request a return within 30 calendar days after confirmed delivery. Contact us before mailing anything. Unauthorized returns may be delayed or refused.</p>

        <h2>Eligibility and hygiene</h2>
        <p>To evaluate a grooming tool under our satisfaction guarantee, reasonable first-use inspection is allowed. The product must be returned with all included components, manuals, and accessories. We may reduce or deny a refund for damage caused by misuse, abuse, unauthorized modification, missing parts, or use beyond what is reasonably necessary to evaluate the product. Consumable personal-care goods that have been opened, gift cards, and items clearly marked final sale are not returnable unless defective or required by law.</p>

        <h2>How to start a return</h2>
        <p>Use the BeardMate contact form and provide your order number, the item you want to return, and the reason for the request. For damage, defects, or an incorrect item, include clear photographs when requested. If approved, we will provide return authorization and instructions.</p>

        <h2>Return destination</h2>
        {% if settings.returns_address != blank %}
          <p>Authorized returns must be sent to:</p><address>{{ settings.returns_address | newline_to_br }}</address>
        {% else %}
          <p>The authorized return destination is provided with your return authorization. Do not send products to a warehouse, carrier, or public business address without written return instructions.</p>
        {% endif %}

        <h2>Return shipping and fees</h2>
        <p>We pay reasonable return-shipping costs when the item is defective, damaged on arrival, or incorrect. For preference-based returns, the customer is responsible for return shipping unless we state otherwise in writing. Original expedited-shipping charges are not refundable. We do not charge a restocking fee for approved returns that meet this policy.</p>

        <h2>Inspection and refunds</h2>
        <p>We will notify you after the return is received and inspected. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method within 10 business days after approval. Your bank or payment provider may require additional time to post the credit. If more than 15 business days have passed since approval, contact us.</p>

        <h2>Cancellations and exchanges</h2>
        <p>Contact us promptly if you need to cancel or change an order. We cannot guarantee changes after fulfillment begins. The fastest exchange method is normally to return the approved item and place a new order.</p>

        <h2>Legal rights</h2>
        <p>This policy does not limit any non-waivable consumer rights that apply where you live.</p>
      {% elsif policy_type == 'shipping' %}
        <h2>Order processing</h2>
        <p>Orders are normally prepared within {{ settings.shipping_processing | default: '1–3 business days' }}, excluding weekends and recognized holidays. Orders placed during promotions or peak periods may require additional time. We will communicate material delays using the contact information provided at checkout.</p>

        <h2>Delivery estimates</h2>
        <p>Standard delivery is generally estimated at {{ settings.shipping_delivery | default: '3–8 business days after dispatch' }}. Delivery dates are estimates, not guarantees, because carrier, weather, address, customs, and regional conditions are outside our direct control.</p>

        <h2>Rates, destinations, and customs</h2>
        <p>Available shipping methods and charges are displayed before payment at checkout. Orders are shipped only to destinations offered during checkout. International customers are responsible for import duties, taxes, brokerage fees, and local requirements unless checkout expressly states that those charges are included.</p>

        <h2>Tracking</h2>
        <p>When tracking is available, we send it after the carrier accepts the parcel. Allow up to 48 hours for the first scan. Carrier tracking may occasionally update before or after actual delivery.</p>

        <h2>Addresses and delivery</h2>
        <p>Customers are responsible for entering a complete, accurate delivery address. Contact us immediately about an error; changes may not be possible after fulfillment. We are not responsible for delays or losses caused by an incorrect address supplied by the customer, but we will help review available carrier options.</p>

        <h2>Lost, damaged, or missing deliveries</h2>
        <p>Inspect your order promptly. Contact us with your order number and photographs if the parcel or product arrives damaged. If tracking has not updated for seven business days or shows delivery that you cannot locate, check with household members and the carrier, then contact us so we can investigate.</p>

        <h2>Split shipments</h2>
        <p>Items may ship separately. If so, you may receive more than one tracking number and no additional shipping charge unless disclosed before payment.</p>
      {% elsif policy_type == 'terms' %}
        <h2>Agreement</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Use govern your access to BeardMate and purchases from {{ legal_name }}. By using the BeardMate website or placing an order, you agree to these terms and the policies linked here. If you do not agree, do not use the website.</p>

        <h2>Use and eligibility</h2>
        <p>You must be legally capable of entering a binding agreement and must provide current, complete, and accurate information. You may not use BeardMate for unlawful, fraudulent, abusive, or unauthorized purposes; interfere with security; or infringe another party’s rights.</p>

        <h2>Products and product information</h2>
        <p>We make reasonable efforts to describe and display products accurately. Colors and appearance may vary by device, and packaging or minor specifications may change without materially reducing product function. Product availability and purchase limits may apply. Directions, warnings, and care instructions supplied with the product must be followed.</p>

        <h2>Orders, prices, and payment</h2>
        <p>An order confirmation acknowledges receipt but does not guarantee acceptance. We may reject or cancel an order for suspected fraud, inventory errors, pricing errors, payment failure, shipping restrictions, or legal compliance. Prices, discounts, taxes, and shipping charges are shown before payment. You authorize the selected payment provider to charge the amount displayed at checkout.</p>

        <h2>Shipping, returns, and refunds</h2>
        <p>Our Shipping Policy and Refund Policy are incorporated into these terms. Title and risk of loss transfer as provided by applicable law and carrier terms. Nothing in these terms limits non-waivable consumer protections.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The BeardMate name, website design, text, graphics, logos, photographs, and other content are owned by or licensed to {{ legal_name }} and are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. No license is granted except the limited right to use BeardMate for personal shopping.</p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>BeardMate may rely on or link to services operated by commerce providers, payment providers, carriers, and other third parties. Their own terms and privacy practices may apply. We are not responsible for third-party services outside our reasonable control.</p>

        <h2>Disclaimer and limitation</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, BeardMate and its products are provided subject to the warranties expressly stated and any non-waivable statutory rights. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from website use or product purchase where such limitations are lawful. These limitations do not apply where prohibited by law.</p>

        <h2>Changes and severability</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms prospectively by posting a revised version. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions continue in effect.</p>

        <h2>Governing law and disputes</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws applicable to {{ legal_name }} at its registered business location, without limiting mandatory rights available to consumers in their home jurisdiction. Please contact us first so we can attempt to resolve concerns directly.</p>
      {% else %}
        <p>Please contact our customer-support team for information about this policy.</p>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="policy-contact-card">
        <h2>Contact BeardMate</h2>
        <p>BeardMate is owned and operated by {{ legal_name }}. Customer support is available using the details below or through our secure contact form.</p>
        {% if settings.support_phone != blank %}<p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{ settings.support_phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' }}">{{ settings.support_phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% if settings.support_email != blank %}<p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email | escape }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% if settings.business_address != blank %}<p>Business address:</p><address>{{ settings.business_address | newline_to_br }}</address>{% endif %}
        <p><a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Open the BeardMate contact page</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{"name": "Policy page", "settings": [], "presets": [{"name": "Policy page"}]}
{% endschema %}
